abstract: >-
  Exact computer-assisted candidate showing that three classical symbols with
  free shared randomness simulate every affine-measurement correlation of the
  six-dimensional cross-polytope. Complete support coverage and rational
  simulator certificates are checked separately. No formal verification,
  external peer review or unaffiliated reproduction is claimed.
